    "body": "Alexander Zolata Juarez, founder and host of the Trailheads and Titans podcast. Handout.\nPosted By: Adrian Pocobelli October 21, 2026\nThis week’s episode features Alexander Zolata Juarez , founder and host of the Trailheads and Titans podcast, discussing the Junior Explorers Challenge, a contest for Canadian youths aged nine to 17.\nJuarez shares how he became interested in mining, explores the issues that resonate with younger people, and discusses how the industry can better connect with youth.\nTo participate in the Junior Explorers Challenge, visit miningmatters.northernminer.com . This month’s deadline is Oct. 31.\nAll this and more with host Adrian Pocobelli .\n“Rattlesnake Railroad”, “Big Western Sky”, “Western Adventure” and “Battle on the Western Frontier” by Brett Van Donsel ( ⁠www.incompetech.com⁠ ).\nLicensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0 License\n⁠creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0⁠\nApple Podcasts: ⁠ https://podcasts.apple.com/ca/podcast/the-northern-miner-podcast/id1099281201⁠\nSpotify: ⁠ https://open.spotify.com/show/78lyjMTRlRwZxQwz2fwQ4K⁠\nYouTube: ⁠ https://www.youtube.com/@NorthernMiner⁠\nSoundcloud: ⁠ https://soundcloud.com/northern-miner\nThe Northern Miner · Alexander Zolata Juarez on youth, mining and the Junior Explorers Challenge\nPrint\nTAG: Podcast\nRepublish this article",
